        <mxCell id="rules" value="KEY RULES&#10;Generate: validate current password, invalidate the old set, then show the new codes once for offline storage.&#10;Redeem: validate an unused code and new password, consume that code, reset the password and send an alert.&#10;Recovery-code endpoints are Admin-only; Staff and Customer do not gain this path." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#273142;fontFamily=Montserrat;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
